    "chunk_text": "Spr\u00e6c \u00f0a ides Scyldinga: Onfoh \u00feissum fulle, freodrihten min, sinces brytta. \u00deu on s\u00e6lum wes, goldwine gumena, ond to Geatum spr\u00e6c mildum wordum, swa sceal man don. Beo wi\u00f0 Geatas gl\u00e6d, geofena gemyndig, nean ond feorran \u00feu nu hafast. Me man s\u00e6gde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu \u00f0e for sunu wolde hererinc habban. Heorot is gef\u00e6lsod, beahsele beorhta; bruc \u00feenden \u00feu mote manigra medo, ond \u00feinum magum l\u00e6f Ic minne can gl\u00e6dne Hro\u00feulf, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fea geogo\u00f0e wile arum healdan, gyf \u00feu \u00e6r \u00feonne he, wine Hwearf \u00fea bi bence \u00fe\u00e6r hyre byre w\u00e6ron, Hre\u00f0ric ond Hro\u00f0mund, ond h\u00e6le\u00fea bearn, giogo\u00f0 Him w\u00e6s ful boren ond freondla\u00feu wordum bew\u00e6gned, ond wunden gold estum geeawed, earmreade N\u00e6nigne ic under swegle selran hyrde hordma\u00f0\u00f0um h\u00e6le\u00fea, sy\u00fe\u00f0an Hama \u00e6tw\u00e6g to \u00fe\u00e6re byrhtan \u00deone hring h\u00e6fde Higelac Geata, nefa Swertinges, nyhstan si\u00f0e, si\u00f0\u00fean he under segne sinc ealgode, He \u00fea fr\u00e6twe w\u00e6g, eorclanstanas ofer y\u00f0a ful, rice \u00feeoden; he under rande gecranc. Gehwearf \u00fea in Francna f\u00e6\u00fem feorh cyninges, breostgew\u00e6du ond se beah somod; wyrsan wigfrecan Heal swege onfeng. Wealh\u00f0eo ma\u00feelode, heo fore \u00fe\u00e6m werede spr\u00e6c: Bruc \u00f0isses",
